  "summary": "The experiment tested a baseline multimodal approach combining PCA-encoded RNA data and ResNet50-encoded images via simple concatenation. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance for this configuration. The impact of encoder choices and fusion strategy remains uncertain without comparative evidence from alternative designs."
